<p class=3D"x_x_xxmsonormal">Hello everyone, I hope you are all doing well,=
</p>
<p class=3D"x_x_xxmsonormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class=3D"x_x_xxmsonormal">March is right around the corner, so here are =
the dates and times for the Orientations that we have planned for March 202=
5.&nbsp; First off, we try to have our new arriving Hosts arrive at the Sta=
te Park on the final day of the current
 month to get settled in and set up for the big day of Orientations that we=
 hold on the 1<sup>st</sup> of the new month.&nbsp; For this month, please =
try to arrive on the 28<sup>th</sup> of February to your designated campsit=
e as we will be jumping into trainings
 in the morning of the 1<sup>st</sup>.&nbsp; If you are unsure of what site=
 you are headed to, please contact me .&nbsp; We try to hold most of the or=
ientations on the 1<sup>st</sup> of the new month so that everyone is all t=
rained up and ready to start their shifts,
 as some of you will have a shift that starts on the 1<sup>st</sup> of Marc=
h.&nbsp; </p>
<p class=3D"x_x_xxmsonormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class=3D"x_x_xxmsonormal">If anyone still needs to complete the required=
 trainings on the Volunteer Voice Website, I have placed a link below.&nbsp=
; The required trainings are the following: The Park Host Safety Training, =
The DAS Discrimination and Harassment Training,
 and the Volunteer Service Agreement. These trainings must be completed ann=
ually, so if you have not done them yet for 2025 then please do. &nbsp;</p>
<p class=3D"x_x_xxmsonormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class=3D"x_x_xxmsonormal"><a href=3D"https://sites.google.com/view/oprdv=
olunteervoice/forms-requirements-resources">OPRD Volunteer Voice - Forms, R=
equirements, Resources</a></p>
<p class=3D"x_x_xxmsonormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class=3D"x_x_xxmsonormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class=3D"x_x_xxmsonormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class=3D"x_x_xxmsonormal">The <b>Welcome Center Operations Orientation</=
b> will be held on December 1st at 10am @ the Welcome Center.&nbsp;
</p>
<p class=3D"x_x_xxmsonormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class=3D"x_x_xxmsonormal">The <b>Yurt &amp; Site Maintenance Orientation=
</b> will be on December 1st at 11am @ the A loop Restroom/Pipe Chase.
</p>
<p class=3D"x_x_xxmsonormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class=3D"x_x_xxmsonormal">The <b>All-Host General Orientation</b> will b=
e at 1pm on March 3rd @ the Welcome Center.&nbsp; For the All-Host General =
Orientation we ask that all of our current and new hosts attend so that we =
can all introduce ourselves to one another
 and also meet the Ranger Staff here at Honeyman State Park as well as talk=
 about upcoming events or trainings that Park Staff will be attending. &nbs=
p;If you have your own chair, please bring it as we tend to run out in the =
welcome center.&nbsp; Once the meet and greet
 portion is over, only our new arrivals for March will need to attend the r=
est of the Orientation. &nbsp;I will also be giving out gloves, hats, and v=
ests if you are in need of those once the presentation is over.
</p>
<p class=3D"x_x_xxmsonormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class=3D"x_x_xxmsonormal">I have also attached a copy of the March Sched=
ule for your viewing pleasure.
</p>
